  "query_preview": "..\n(Wednesday through Monday)\nIssued at 137 AM CDT Tue Aug 4 2026\n\nExpect hot and dry conditions across the area as a upper level ridge \nremains just to our north. Looks like will stay below heat advisory \ncriteria through this weekend. However, it will still be hot during \nthe afternoon, so please follow heat safety precautions. Highs will \nbe in the mid 90s to around 102 and lows will be in the upper 60s \nand 70s. A weakness in the ridge is possible this weekend and \nchances of convection increase across Oklahoma. A little of this \nactivity may slip south into north Texas. However, keeping our \nforecast dry for now.",
